{"title": "Thorn Blade", "pageid": 9109, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Thorn_Blade", "categories": ["Bugs", "Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "Scimitars", "Rare items", "Sources of Slashing damage", "Sources of Poison damage", "Gish (hybrid) set", "Poison set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Thorn Blade image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Thorn Blade</span></a> is a rare, lightly enchanted (+1) <a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\">Scimitar</a> that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage with melee weapons attacks while <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentrating</a> and grants the ability to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Ensnaring_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike (Melee)\">Ensnaring Strike (Melee)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a hr